  The hard part is that when you see bad output, you have two completely different root causes that look the same:       
                                                                                                                         
  ┌──────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┐    
  │    Looks like    │                     Root cause                      │                  Fix                   │    
  ├──────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤    
  │ Agent chases at  │ Builder misread the ambiguous guardrail ("update    │ Fix the spec, re-align with            │
