  ├──────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤    
  │ Agent chases at  │ Builder read the spec correctly but coded the       │ Just fix the code                      │
  │ wrong day        │ condition wrong                                     │                                        │    
  └──────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                                                                                                         
  You can't tell which it is from the output alone — you have to trace back through the spec and the code together.      
